    "description": "If you're a passionate Guest Relations Manager with drive and ambition, SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates in Noida is the place for you. We're growing fast and need talented people to grow with us.\n\nAbout SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates:\nSOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates is a leading organization in the Hybrid sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Deliver exceptional guest experiences in line with brand standards\n• Monitor F&B service quality and maintain hygiene standards\n• Assist in menu planning, costing, and food festival coordination\n• Develop and maintain relationships with corporate clients\n• Prepare daily operating reports and present to management\n• Manage front office operations including check-in/check-out\n• Ensure compliance with FSSAI, health, and safety regulations\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 1-3 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Housekeeping Standards\n• Proficiency in Opera PMS\n• Proficiency in MICE\n• Proficiency in PMS Systems\n• Proficiency in Customer Relations\n• Proficiency in Crisis Management\n• Proficiency in Hotel Management\n• Proficiency in Travel Management\n\nWork Mode: Hybrid - Flexible work-from-home and office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Transportation and conveyance allowance\n• Professional development and training programs\n• Employee stock options (ESOPs) for eligible roles\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 4 LPA - 9 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Noida, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with SOTC Travel Asia Pacific Associates!",
